lean/ClmVerify/REPORT.md:5:**What is and is not verified.** The proofs are about the Lean definitions in `ClmVerify/Scan.lean`, `Windows.lean`, `Folds.lean` and `Backtest.lean`. The Rust code (`finance/crates/*`, `src/tensor/ops/selective_scan.rs`) and the CubeCL GPU kernels are **not** proven. They are *tested* against the executable `clmcheck`, which runs exactly these definitions. This is the same arrangement as `lean/MotifDecoder`.
lean/ClmVerify/REPORT.md:9:- **Status**: every theorem below is proven. The build has zero errors and zero warnings. There is no `sorry`, no added `axiom` and no `native_decide`.
lean/ClmVerify/REPORT.md:10:- **Size**: 1,848 lines (definitions 403, proofs 1,180, `Axioms.lean` 82, `Main.lean` 183).
